---
import Page from '../components/Page.astro'
---
<Page currentPath="/contact" title="Contact — Jhelum Labs" description="Get in touch with Jhelum Labs for research inquiries, technical collaboration, and questions about our AI models.">
  <div class="ct-page shell">

    <header class="ct-header">
      <h1 class="ct-title">Contact Jhelum Labs</h1>
      <p class="ct-tagline">Let's Connect</p>
    </header>

    <div class="ct-body">

      <p class="ct-lead">
        We welcome inquiries from researchers, developers, organizations, and
        individuals interested in artificial intelligence, machine learning, and
        the development of advanced AI systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you have a question about our models, are interested in our research,
        wish to discuss a technical collaboration, or want to learn more about
        Jhelum Labs, we would be glad to hear from you.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in Touch</h2>

      <div class="ct-cards">
        <div class="ct-card">
          <span class="ct-card-label">General Inquiries</span>
          <p>For questions about Jhelum Labs, our projects, and our work.</p>
          <a href="mailto:team@jhelumlabs.in">team@jhelumlabs.in →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ct-card">
          <span class="ct-card-label">Research &amp; Collaboration</span>
          <p>For research discussions, technical collaboration, and opportunities to exchange ideas.</p>
          <a href="mailto:team@jhelumlabs.in?subject=Research+Collaboration">team@jhelumlabs.in →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ct-card">
          <span class="ct-card-label">Models &amp; Technical Support</span>
          <p>For questions about our AI models, documentation, releases, and technical resources.</p>
          <a href="mailto:team@jhelumlabs.in?subject=Technical+Support">team@jhelumlabs.in →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ct-info">
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:team@jhelumlabs.in">team@jhelumlabs.in</a></p>
        <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://jhelumlabs.in">https://jhelumlabs.in</a></p>
      </div>

      <p>
        We aim to make our work accessible, encourage meaningful technical
        discussions, and connect with people who share an interest in advancing
        artificial intelligence.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        <strong>Jhelum Labs</strong> — Building AI. Advancing Research. Exploring What Comes Next.
      </blockquote>

    </div>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
.ct-page {
  padding: clamp(64px,9vw,108px) 0 clamp(80px,11vw,130px);
}
.ct-header {
  max-width: 780px;
  margin-bottom: 56px;
  padding-bottom: 40px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.ct-title {
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.8rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  line-height: 1.05;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.ct-tagline {
  font-size: clamp(1rem,1.8vw,1.2rem);
  color: var(--text-soft);
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.ct-body { max-width: 720px }
.ct-lead {
  font-size: clamp(1.05rem,1.8vw,1.2rem);
  line-height: 1.72;
  color: var(--text-soft);
  margin: 0 0 1.2em;
}
.ct-body p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.78;
  color: var(--text-soft);
  margin: 0 0 1.1em;
}
.ct-body h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.4rem,2.5vw,1.9rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 2.4em 0 0.9em;
  padding-top: 1.2em;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-subtle);
}
.ct-body strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600 }
.ct-body a {
  color: var(--text);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
  transition: opacity .15s;
}
.ct-body a:hover { opacity: .7 }
.ct-body blockquote {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  padding: 4px 0 4px 20px;
  margin: 2.2em 0;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--text-soft);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* Cards */
.ct-cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px,1fr));
  gap: 16px;
  margin: 0 0 2em;
}
.ct-card {
  padding: 22px 24px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: var(--surface-card);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}
.ct-card-label {
  font-size: .72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.ct-card p {
  font-size: .88rem !important;
  color: var(--text-soft);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 !important;
}
.ct-card a {
  font-size: .84rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

/* Info block */
.ct-info {
  background: var(--surface-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 22px 26px;
  margin-bottom: 1.5em;
}
.ct-info p {
  margin: 0 0 4px !important;
  font-size: .95rem !important;
}
.ct-info p:last-child { margin: 0 !important }

@media (max-width:600px) {
  .ct-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr }
}
</style>
